        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Flame Arts:\nGained by using Inferno Rhapsody, as well as Night Rain and Soulfire\nEvery 3 Flame Arts = 1 Extra Attack\nActivating the 3rd Flame Art with Inferno Rhapsody has additional effects\nDescent:\nGained whenever ANY ally effect causes draw\nEvery 8 Descent, generate a Heavensfall (Maximum 10 times, or 80 Descent)"
          }
        }
      ]
