        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "7 Inferno = 7 hits\n6 + 6 + 7 = 19/3 = 6 Flame Art Activates x 3 hits = 18 Hits\n3 AP Soulfire = 3 x 2 = 6/3 = 2 Activates x 3 hits =6 Hits\n3 Soliloquy 6 Flame Art Activate + Draw X = 10 Draw Ideally\n3 AP Soulfire = Draw 3, 3 Descent\nTotal Draw 13 possible, total Descent possible 15 + 3 = 2 Heavens fall = 6 Hits\n7 + 18 + 6 + 6 = 37 Hits technically possible (Even more possible if more AP into Soulfire)\n(This build scales quite well with extra AP into Soulfire)"
          }
        },
