          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Ego Manifestation"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "E1:\nNot important, just small damage boost\nE2:\nMaking Heavenfall becomes easier and small damage buff to Inferno Rhapsodies\nE3:\nMakes Soulfire 3, more interesting ig, otherwise pretty eh\nE4:\nOnly boosts Heavensfall damage\nE5:\nPotential levels, not super important, but kinda adds up for Heavensfall\nE6:\nNow this is lowkey crazy 6 Moral for Inferno Rhapsodies 120%\nEvery 3rd Heavensfall (technically) gets +3 hits doubling its damage (Soulfire 3)"
          }
        }
      ]
