          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30048_col2",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Negotiate: If you need the moral to reach cap, this is always good\nQuick Shelling: 2 free Hits, 0 cost Cantrip\nLeap Attack: Quick Shelling but stronger and more conditional\nPrecision Aim: Quick Shelling but for Attunement Synergies (Attunment Draw)"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30048_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Blazing: This is an insanely perfect card for Fei, but why the heck has it Exhaust??????"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30048_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30048_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany II"
              },
              "rating": "3/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30048_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "2/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Formation 1: 2.5 Moral for Rhapsody alone isn't worth much\nFormation 2: Cycle -1, permanently, so very good, besides for turn 1\nFormation 3: Great version if you're trying to OTK for consistentcy\nFormation 4: The Extra hits that scale off of moral are great\nFormation 5: Creates a different Inferno version, creates 3 Descent instead of 1, but no Draw"
